	In some cases, the mimics do a good job of hiding in the shop.  But
in others, they still are extremely obvious.  I mean, there are no ']'
objects, so if you see an ']' then you can be sure that it is a mimic.
Perhaps, in a later version, there will be objects which use the ']' as a
symbol or eliminate the mimics ability to be this character.
